    "detail": {
      "id": 1320802,
      "name": "[Tsukishiro Yanagi] Kagura's Dance",
      "desc": "While triggering the fifth move of a <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack</color> in the <color=#FFFFFF>Jougen</color> stance or triggering the fourth move of a <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack</color> in the <color=#FFFFFF>Kagen</color> stance, repeatedly press or hold Basic Attack <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to <color=#2BAD00>extend the skill duration</color>, slash continuously, and increase <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color> dealt by Tsukishiro Yanagi by 4%, stacking up to 15 times and lasting 8s. Repeated triggers refresh the duration. During consecutive slashes, DMG taken by Tsukishiro Yanagi is <color=#2BAD00>reduced by 40%</color>, and after triggering <color=#FFFFFF>Swift Ruten</color>, pressing Basic Attack <IconMap:Icon_Normal> <color=#2BAD00>transitions to continuous slashes of the alternate stance</color>.",
